### Checked and cleared (no finding)
- **Pass 2 sweep**, 3×3 crops at 1.6× plus targeted 500–1200 dpi re-renders. All 33 aisle corridors **100% free end-to-end** by column scan (`y 104–332` for aisles 1–17, `y 352–530` for 18–33) — zero gaps, so no store-24 "green at the badge mouth, white deeper in".
- **Every department frontage green:** Dairy (`y 82–102` clear across `x 380–700`), Market, Deli, Bakery, Seafood, Produce, Floral, Pharmacy, Restrooms approach. Checkout lanes sealed, front action alley green. `MARKET` has no extracted anchor (vector/label vocabulary gap, not a map defect) — its floor is covered by `must [820,180]`.
- **Seafood label inside the NE exclusion** — the one thing that looks like a store-24 repeat. Cleared: the 5 cooler doors on the chevron `(936,351)–(891,392)` swing **NW onto the customer alcove** (confirmed at 1100 dpi), the region east of them is one contiguous 489 m² space with staff double-swing doors, hinged staff rooms and an exterior curbside door, and it holds zero product labels. This guide also prints "Pharmacy" over its sealed dispensing room, so a department name over back-of-house is its established convention. Green runs right up to the cooler doors (`must [890,358]` verified).
- **All 10 culled pockets classified:** 5 checkstand lane interiors; enclosed room S of checkstands (`288,660`, hinged door at `266,632`); enclosed room in the south-wall cluster (`374,679`); deli service island (`846,288`); sliver between the curved storefront and the straight 16-vertex boundary chord (`635,695`, outside the drawn wall); dead-end crevice beside the west-facing floral cooler (`694,590` — the 0.5 m strip against the doors survives, connected full length, no labels).
- **Independent blocked-area scan:** inside boundary ∧ not-free ∧ not-fixture/wall/exclusion yields only those four components — no unexplained sealed floor anywhere.
- **All 217 product labels** on the map have reachable floor within 2 m (re-verified after the fix). No orange isolated pockets, no purple staff mask, all anchor pairs connected.
- **Inclusions:** both consistent; the rect-1 overlap with fixture `(787.6,383.3,807.2,441.4)` is harmless — `derive.build_free` does `free |= free_raw & incl_mask`, so an inclusion can never open a fixture.

